>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relevant.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sumPrecision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> relevant.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> meanAveragePrecision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryResults</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    retrieved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RetrievalResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    relevant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> aps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryResults.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">qr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> averagePrecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qr.retrieved, qr.relevant));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aps.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ap, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aps.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MRR（Mean Reciprocal Rank）是另一个常用的排序指标，它关注的是第一个相关文档出现在排序列表中的位置。Reciprocal Rank = 1 / (第一个相关文档的排名)。MRR 适合评估「找到一个好答案」的场景，如问答系统和导航型搜索。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>对排序敏感度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MAP</td>\n<td>全面排序质量</td>\n<td>通用检索评估</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MRR</td>\n<td>首个相关结果位置</td>\n<td>问答、导航搜索</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P@K</td>\n<td>Top-K 精确度</td>\n<td>搜索结果页面</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R@K</td>\n<td>Top-K 覆盖度</td>\n<td>召回导向系统</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ndcg-与多级相关性\">NDCG 与多级相关性</h2><p>NDCG（Normalized Discounted Cumulative Gain）是处理多级相关性标注的标准指标。与二值相关性（相关/不相关）不同，多级标注允许区分「非常相关」、「较相关」和「略微相关」，NDCG 能够在评分中反映这种差异。</p>\n<p>DCG（Discounted Cumulative Gain）的计算：对排序列表中每个位置 i，将该位置文档的相关性得分 rel(i) 除以位置折扣 log₂(i+1)，然后累加。NDCG 是 DCG 与理想排序（IDCG）的比值，归一化到 [0, 1] 范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const dcg = (rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;, relevanceMap: Map&lt;string, number&gt;, k: number): number =&gt; {&#10;  let score = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; Math.min(k, rankedDocs.length); i++) {&#10;    const rel = relevanceMap.g